# Line endings of the shared JavaScript libraries programme's work in this repository (milestone
# SJL-7, convention 17: LF line endings under .gitattributes), added on 2026-10-16. Files that existed
# before keep the endings they were committed with; these lines name only what SJL-7 adds.

# THE PINNED UNICODE ARCHIVE IS BINARY. Its files are held by their SHA-256 in
# data/unicode/pins/unicode.pin, and a checkout filter that rewrote one line ending would move a hash
# on one platform. The pin and the archive's README stay text: nothing hashes them.
data/unicode/pins/ucd-17.0.0/** binary
data/unicode/pins/emoji-17.0.0/** binary
data/unicode/pins/ecma262/** binary
data/unicode/pins/unicode-LICENSE.txt binary
data/unicode/pins/unicode.pin text eol=lf
data/unicode/pins/README.md text eol=lf
data/unicode/pins/ecma262/ECMA-alternative-copyright-notice.txt text eol=lf

# The projects SJL-7 adds, their tests and probe, and the documents of the programme.
src/Unicode.Algorithms/** text eol=lf
src/Unicode.Segmentation/** text eol=lf
src/Unicode.Tables/** text eol=lf
src/Unicode.Generation/** text eol=lf
tests/Unicode.Algorithms.Tests/** text eol=lf
tests/Unicode.Architecture.Tests/** text eol=lf
tests/Unicode.ReferenceArms/** text eol=lf
# Rule SL10's witness for CRLF line endings must keep its CRs, so it alone is stored as-is.
tests/Unicode.Architecture.Tests/witnesses/SL10-crlf-line-endings.cs.witness -text
probes/** text eol=lf
scripts/** text eol=lf
docs/** text eol=lf
src/assurance.config.json text eol=lf
src/assurance.manifest.json text eol=lf
src/CODE-ASSURANCE.md text eol=lf
src/HUMAN_REVIEW.md text eol=lf
CHANGELOG.md text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
data/unicode/pins/broiler-vm/** text eol=lf
